    "ReqAbility1 = 804353 on the Knight of Xoroth class trainer (900017), but SpellbookOfferData.h kept",
    "FirstSpellId = 0 for 806869, so the Book of Ascension sent RequiredAbility = 0 in SMSG_TRAINER_LIST",
    "while ranks 3-7 required 806869-806873. A level 60 Defiance knight holds only rank 7 (806874) in the",
    "client spellbook; on the next spell learned the client redraws rows against its spellbook and marks",
    "only rank 2 as available because its RequiredAbility was 0, stalling the Train button (#13501).",
    "Expected: both on open and after training another spell, the book sends RequiredAbility = 804353 and",
    "state = 2 (Known) for 806869, keeps rank 3 requiring 806869, and refuses direct purchase of 806869."
